coder-new
=========

Coder Noir combines Superlogical's Static Noir color values with Coder's
neutral accent and cursor. It uses only the reference palette values;
OpenAgents implements the shared roles and rendering adapters in Rust.

The original layout and Markdown/diff renderers are adapted from:

  grok-build — https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build
  Git commit: 2bdd1d6a6369de0e8c68132ea4539e9abd9e14a8
  SOURCE_REV: 559751fdcec02d413e4c57c8832ab275e4f44980
