The screen layout, editor, shared Coder Noir mapping, and SVG exporter are
implemented in OpenAgents. Markdown and Edit calls retain the Grok layout
and public syntax grammars, recolored through Coder Noir. Their source
attribution and licenses are retained in code-highlight/NOTICE.
